1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,650
Such a potent poison... It really is Hunchback Meng.

25
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,890
Stay attentive.

26
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,090
If you detect any trace of Hunchback Meng,

27
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,970
tell me immediately.

28
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,250
Master,

29
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:23,650
are we going after that Soul Formation old toad ?

30
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:25,810
Just do as you're told.

31
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:36,170
Why do I always have to do all the hard work ?

32
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:40,130
How shameless ! You're just scared of that Soul Formation cultivator.

33
00:02:57,720 --> 00:03:00,090
There's another alpha beast in this tornado.

34
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:09,450
It's probing me...

35
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,090
Kill it.

36
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,610
False Nascent Soul ?

37
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:09,210
I can't get close.

38
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,490
I can't fight it directly.

39
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:37,010
Retreat another 10 zhang.

40
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:50,010
I refuse to believe my Divine Sense can't cut you !

41
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:01,970
False Nascent Soul is the limit of what I can face.

42
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:05,570
There must be other alpha beasts in tornadoes.

43
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,330
As I thought,

44
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,730
the closer we get to the end,

45
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,610
the stronger the beasts.

46
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:25,450
Master ! Master !

47
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:29,050
I found that old toad !

48
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:48,570
Little ant that poisoned my brethren,

49
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:54,410
I will unleash divine punishment upon you !

50
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:54,650
Tornado Beast King
Peak Late stage Soul Formation

51
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,890
Peak Late stage Soul Formation !?

52
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,050
This is...

53
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:16,330
That old bastard and his toad

54
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:18,370
relied on their Soul Formation cultivation

55
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,130
to fight their way through.

56
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:20,930
But then...

57
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,810
it attracted this trial's king.

58
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,770
Thankfully, I didn't act recklessly.

59
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,810
The consequences would've been terrible.

60
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:31,090
Li Tian !

61
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,370
Let's let him fight.

62
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,890
Even if he doesn't die, he'll be severely injured.

63
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,450
Master,

64
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:03,290
the end of the first trial is right there.

65
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:06,130
Shouldn't we take advantage of the chaos to leave ?

66
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,930
Not now,

67
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:18,970
get closer.

68
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,570
Just do what you're told !

69
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:34,090
Go a bit closer,

70
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,770
we can't see from far away.

71
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:38,690
What a great spectacle !

72
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,330
Damn beast !

73
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,690
You pushed me this far !

74
00:08:57,560 --> 00:09:00,370
This black tower cannot stop me.

75
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:03,410
You slaughtered countless of my brethren.

76
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:05,410
Little ant,

77
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:09,490
come out and die !

78
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:17,610
Bastard ! Bastard !

79
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:21,610
I... I cannot die here !

80
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,730
Li Tian...

81
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:31,610
Come to think of it,

82
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:34,130
you've only been with me for 1000 years.

83
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,530
I'm sorry Li Tian.

84
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:43,490
This old man needs to live a few more years !

85
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:50,250
This is your fate.

86
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:53,570
Blame Tornado Beast King for it !

87
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:13,090
Hahahahaha !

88
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:21,650
We mustn't waste your body either.

89
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:56,810
You actually devoured the core of your high quality Spirit Beast.

90
00:10:57,320 --> 00:11:00,570
I raised it for 1000 years

91
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:04,490
step by step until high quality.

92
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:10,130
It almost became a Desolate Beast.

93
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:12,570
Just one more step

94
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:16,930
and Li Tian would've become a Desolate Beast !

95
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,650
It's your fault !

96
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:21,050
You forced me to devour Li Tian !

97
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:25,410
How laughable, it was completely loyal to you.

98
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,730
But in the end

99
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:32,290
you only raised it for it to become a pill.

100
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:34,450
So what if I did ?

101
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,610
What does it change ?

102
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,890
Enough talk !

103
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:41,770
Now that I'm also at Peak Late stage Soul Formation,

104
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:44,250
let's have a fight,

105
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:47,170
you damn beast !

106
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,330
Die !

107
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:17,130
Nine Nethers Poison,

108
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,810
explode !

109
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:50,010
My subjects,

110
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:54,050
sacrifice your bodies for your king !

111
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:17,970
Go !

112
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:03,770
Your life artifact is shattered.

113
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,850
Now die !

114
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:09,370
Damn beast...

115
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:12,610
Did you think my Poison King Cauldron

116
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:16,290
was forged with just any amount of Heaven Severing Poison ?

117
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:28,050
I want you, damn beast, to pay with your life for Li Tian !

118
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:35,010
Heaven Severing Poison...

119
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:36,570
Explode for me !

120
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:39,250
Explode !

121
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:04,810
He actually won !

122
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,290
Quick, let's go, let's go !

123
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,650
If that old toad finds us

124
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:12,210
we won't be able to leave !

125
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:14,170
Get closer.

126
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,810
Are you crazy !?

127
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:32,570
With my cultivation,

128
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:34,490
the trials will be perilous.

129
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:36,690
A Soul Formation's bag of holding

130
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,570
might give me an edge.

131
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:41,770
That's a Soul Formation cultivator !

132
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:44,410
He might be one step in the grave

133
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:46,410
but killing you

134
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:49,610
is as easy as crushing an ant  !

135
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,490
I can't kill him

136
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,860
but that doesn't mean he can't die.

137
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:55,970
Either we go all in

138
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,850
or we don't try at all.

139
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:08,330
Mere Core Formation and Nascent Soul beasts dare to catch me ?

140
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:10,050
Ridiculous.

141
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:15,210
It's you !

142
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:18,850
We're dead !

143
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:25,770
How dare you ?

144
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:29,090
You're out of fuel.

145
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,610
Come down !

146
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:34,930
How dare you !?

147
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,130
You...

148
00:16:36,880 --> 00:16:38,210
A mere Core Formation...

149
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:41,090
A mere Core Formation brat !

150
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:04,490
They... saw us !

151
00:17:15,760 --> 00:19:37,970
A life artifact is similar to a blood-refined artifact. The cultivator links his life to an artifact. Although it makes the artifact stronger and it makes the artifact grow together with the cultivator's cultivation level, if the life artifact is destroyed, the consequences are terrible for the cultivator.

The Poison King Cauldron was Hunchback Meng's life artifact. After it was destroyed, he was greatly weakened. That's part of the reason why Wang Lin was able to finish him off.

152
00:17:44,230 --> 00:17:51,360
Count the specks of time

153
00:17:48,110 --> 00:17:51,360
floating down gently.

154
00:17:51,470 --> 00:17:57,600
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny

155
00:17:58,470 --> 00:18:05,120
Forever lock away the scars

156
00:18:02,270 --> 00:18:05,120
of this mortal life.

157
00:18:05,130 --> 00:18:11,640
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

158
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:19,360
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

159
00:18:14,710 --> 00:18:19,360
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

160
00:18:19,190 --> 00:18:26,520
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

161
00:18:21,230 --> 00:18:26,520
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

162
00:18:26,710 --> 00:18:29,040
I will ask the heavens who exactly

163
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:33,800
sliced open this world

164
00:18:30,190 --> 00:18:33,800
to let the rain fall in.

165
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,800
I will refine the world

166
00:18:35,630 --> 00:18:38,320
to make our palm lines say

167
00:18:38,270 --> 00:18:40,680
that we will live forever.

168
00:18:40,430 --> 00:18:43,600
Walking off the beaten path

169
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:46,680
through heaven and earth.

170
00:18:47,710 --> 00:18:53,640
Before returning to dust,

171
00:18:49,630 --> 00:18:53,640
I will refine this mortal body.

172
00:18:54,910 --> 00:19:02,520
The left shore is the joyous laughter

173
00:18:58,790 --> 00:19:02,520
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

174
00:19:02,270 --> 00:19:09,120
The right shore is an eternal silence

175
00:19:03,870 --> 00:19:09,120
lingering under the candlelight.

176
00:19:09,070 --> 00:19:12,000
To overturn this fate,

177
00:19:11,750 --> 00:19:16,360
I will walk against the heavens.

178
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:23,520
I will even gather the clouds

179
00:19:19,070 --> 00:19:23,520
to illuminate the sky for you.

180
00:19:23,670 --> 00:19:27,760
All this sadness was not meaningless.

181
00:19:27,510 --> 00:19:31,080
How many lives and deaths
have passed in the blink of an eye ?

182
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:36,880
I vow to break

183
00:19:33,070 --> 00:19:36,880
this chess game of fate.

184
00:19:37,950 --> 00:19:47,840
I vow to break

185
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:47,840
this chess game of fate.
